# What must NEVER reach forgelegacy.app. Gitignore syntax, read by wrangler at deploy time.
#
# ⚠ The 4 MB design-tool export. It is git-ignored, so it is present on every machine that has ever
# opened this folder and tracked by nothing — exactly the shape of file that gets published by accident.
# Uploaded, it becomes a public indexable page at /_exported-bundle.html whose <title> is "Bundled Page"
# and whose entire body lives inside a JavaScript string. The live site serves it as 404. Keep it that way.
_exported-bundle.html

# Repo documentation, not a page.
README.md
wrangler.jsonc
.assetsignore
